# 우는 흑요석 비밀 발전과제 동기화
# 영구 수집 상태를 기준으로 누락된 발전과제를 보정합니다.
execute if score #crying_overworld var matches 1 run advancement grant @s only 3_polarnight/90_crying_overworld
execute if score #crying_dried var matches 1 run advancement grant @s only 3_polarnight/91_crying_dried
execute if score #crying_frozen var matches 1 run advancement grant @s only 3_polarnight/92_crying_frozen
execute if score #crying_dawn var matches 1 run advancement grant @s only 3_polarnight/93_crying_dawn
execute if score #crying_vault_opened var matches 1 run advancement grant @s only 3_polarnight/94_obsidian_vault
